Answer: To delete a snapshot:

aws ec2 delete-snapshot --snapshot-id <snapshot-id>
21. How to Recover an Entire EC2 Server Using Snapshot?

Answer: To recover an EC2 instance from a snapshot:

Create an EBS volume from the snapshot.
Attach the volume to a new EC2 instance.
Mount the volume and configure the instance as needed.
